[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10502.63, "timestamp": "02:55:02", "text": "呃，不要太关注数字，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10505.59, "timestamp": "02:55:05", "text": "明白了，那时很容易分辨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10507.349, "timestamp": "02:55:07", "text": "去做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10509.59, "timestamp": "02:55:09", "text": "是啊，因为很容易就能说出任何事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10511.59, "timestamp": "02:55:11", "text": "比如不要做这个或那个。你应该"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10514.87, "timestamp": "02:55:14", "text": "做这个，做那件事。但为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10517.99, "timestamp": "02:55:17", "text": "要做到这一点，很难。再次，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10521.03, "timestamp": "02:55:21", "text": "那是验证，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10524.63, "timestamp": "02:55:24", "text": "那也是一种痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10528.79, "timestamp": "02:55:28", "text": "是的。是的。是的。验证方面的内容。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10531.67, "timestamp": "02:55:31", "text": "这就是为什么我认为我不认为自己是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10533.59, "timestamp": "02:55:33", "text": "自我推销"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10536.07, "timestamp": "02:55:36", "text": "就像其他 Discord 服务器一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10540.309, "timestamp": "02:55:40", "text": "任何事物。但当被要求询问时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10542.07, "timestamp": "02:55:42", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10544.71, "timestamp": "02:55:44", "text": "当我被问及类似的事情时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10547.51, "timestamp": "02:55:47", "text": "所以，如果你还记得的话，就点个赞吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10549.67, "timestamp": "02:55:49", "text": "就像前一天在瓦尔溪流上那样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10551.75, "timestamp": "02:55:51", "text": "昨天对"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10553.99, "timestamp": "02:55:53", "text": "呃，当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10558.469, "timestamp": "02:55:58", "text": "呃，就像有些人喜欢……呃，就像推广……"}]